.TH KEYLATCH\-RUN 1 "2026-05-17" "keylatch" "Keylatch Manual"
.SH NAME
keylatch\-run \- run a command with injected credentials
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B keylatch run
.I connection
.RB [ \-\-runtime
.IR mode ]
.RB [ \-\-dry\-run ]
.RB [ \-\-clean\-env ]
.RB [ \-\-extra
.IR var ]
.B \-\-
.I command
.RI [ args... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBkeylatch run\fR launches \fIcommand\fR with credentials for \fIconnection\fR
injected via the selected runtime mode. In all modes, raw credential values are
never returned to the calling process. All four v1.0.0 runtime modes are
permitted in LLM sessions.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-runtime \fImode\fR
Runtime mode for credential exchange. Valid values:
.RS
.TP
.B gateway_typed
Gateway with typed, schema-validated exchange (default).
.TP
.B gateway_sdk
Gateway with SDK-compatible exchange.
.TP
.B direct_brokered
Direct injection via a trusted broker process. No gateway required.
.TP
.B gateway_proxy
Gateway via local credential proxy (HTTPS MITM).
.RE
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Print what would be injected without running the command.
.TP
.B \-\-clean\-env
Reduce the child environment to PATH, HOME, USER, SHELL, TERM, LANG, and
injected credential variables. All other variables are stripped.
.TP
.B \-\-extra \fIvar\fR
Preserve an additional variable when \fI--clean-env\fR is set. Repeatable.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
User error (invalid arguments or configuration).
.TP
.B 2
Security block (LLM session guard prevented execution).
.TP
.B 3
Missing (connection or credential not found).
.TP
.B 4
Backend unavailable.
.TP
.B 5
Operation failed.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR keylatch (1),
.BR keylatch\-runtime\-doctor (1),
.BR keylatch\-proxy (1)
